    <string name="autotab_disclaimer_title">Before you begin</string>
    <string name="autotab_disclaimer_subtitle">Please read the terms of use</string>
    <string name="autotab_disclaimer_scroll_hint">Scroll down to continue</string>
    <string name="autotab_disclaimer_agree">I agree</string>
    <string name="autotab_disclaimer_1">The algorithm is optimised for monophonic guitar signal analysis. A dense mix of several instruments significantly reduces recognition accuracy.</string>
    <string name="autotab_disclaimer_2">Best results are achieved when analysing fingerpicking and solo parts — i.e. single notes played in sequence.</string>
    <string name="autotab_disclaimer_3">The algorithm automatically detects the guitar tuning. If the result is unsatisfactory, you can check the exact tuning in the Tuner section.</string>
    <string name="autotab_disclaimer_4">Chords and mixed recordings are not supported — the algorithm is not designed to analyse simultaneously sounding notes or multi-track recordings.</string>

